api_register.s:
New endpoint POST /api/register: free registration. Creates the pending registration (st 'r') + a login account (via find_or_create_user from step 1) + a session cookie. No Paystack at all.

New file: src/routes/api/register/+server.ts. Base it on the OLD src/routes/api/register-init-payment/+server.ts (validation block lines 30-115 stays identical: sessionEmail/phone resolution, toStored/phoneReal, 400 guards for missing fields / invalid email / invalid phone / short password, partner-code normalization + fab check + amount_kobo). Replace everything from line 118 onward:

  const i = new_id();
  const p_name = `${data.firstName} ${data.lastName}`;

  const pending: Registration = {
    s: 'reg', fn: data.firstName, ln: data.lastName, sn: data.school,
    e: email, amt: amount_kobo, st: 'r', v: 0, d: Date.now(), ac
